{"id":"ocasio_n","lemma":"ocasión","pos":"noun","rank":1588,"glosses":["occasion"],"ipa":"/okaˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ocasiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-ocasi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Era una buena ocasión.","en":"It was a good opportunity.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/512866"},{"text":"Tiendo a balbucear en ocasiones.","en":"I do tend to babble at times.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803946"},{"text":"Será una ocasión muy importante.","en":"It'll be a big occasion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587439"},{"text":"Lo he intentado en diversas ocasiones.","en":"I've tried it several times.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728821"},{"text":"En esta ocasión es diferente.","en":"This time it's different.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/508934"}]}